              "by": "NecroPolo",
              "role": "composer",
              "paragraphs": [
                [
                  {
                    "t": "I’m still sort of pissed about the fact that X-SID was stolen from Jeff and became spread, therefore became never finished. Quite understandable reaction. Still, it is a pity as this tracker is bloody awesome. Title is a reference for the hyper freezing train movie and subsequent Netflix TV show. One year later this SID became completely intergrated into the band Diabolus in Musica, where it was originally intended. It was just a demo around the time of Vincenzo’s C64GT Challenge."
                  }
                ],
                [
                  {
                    "t": "So, the SID became released first."
                  }
                ]
              ]
            }
          ],
